>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. VALIDATE-ACCOUNT.
AUTHOR. SecurePay-Lab.
REMARKS. Core banking simulator — GnuCOBOL, not IBM z/OS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ARG-COUNT        PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 WS-ACCOUNT-ID       PIC X(10).
01 WS-AMOUNT-TXT       PIC X(16).
01 WS-AMOUNT-CENTS     PIC 9(11) VALUE 0.
01 WS-AMOUNT           PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-BALANCE          PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 500000.00.
01 WS-RESULT           PIC X(10).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-ARG-COUNT FROM ARGUMENT-NUMBER
    IF WS-ARG-COUNT < 2
       MOVE "DECLINED" TO WS-RESULT
       DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-RESULT)
       STOP RUN
    END-IF
    ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-ID FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT-TXT FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-AMOUNT-TXT) TO WS-AMOUNT-CENTS
    COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = WS-AMOUNT-CENTS / 100
    IF WS-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE AND WS-AMOUNT > 0
       MOVE "APPROVED" TO WS-RESULT
    ELSE
       MOVE "DECLINED" TO WS-RESULT
    END-IF
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-RESULT)
    STOP RUN.
